{"id":"n27264-1-7","stage":3,"title":"거미 · 蜘蛛","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27264-1-7-1","ko":"너는 왜 그렇게 거미를 무서워하니?","zh":"你为什么那么怕蜘蛛啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"거미를","meaning":"蜘蛛","explanation":"거미：蜘蛛；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거미","audio":"/audio/9b3c26809b20b88ebdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27264","senseId":"1","lemma":"거미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거미를","audio":"/audio/5f1d6ad920e9162d2698.mp3"}},{"text":"무서워하니?","meaning":"害怕","explanation":"무서워하다：害怕；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"무서워하다","audio":"/audio/08383fc985a33e1cd44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55631","senseId":"1","lemma":"무서워하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무서워하니","audio":"/audio/39cc70f264abc079543c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","au