8243ad11245b602e.mp3"}},{"text":"징그럽잖아.","meaning":"令人恶心，瘆人","explanation":"징그럽다：令人恶心，瘆人；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"징그럽다","audio":"/audio/7c6cc8583a3af1ef734c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77713","senseId":"1","lemma":"징그럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"징그럽잖아","audio":"/audio/caf2ea11cb50a288d943.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"042fbd833c9fdd6b","term":"여덟","zh":"八","audio":"/audio/042fbd833c9fdd6b8ba3.mp3","entryId":"17284","definition":"七加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["여덜"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"22784","definition":"计算单个东西的计量单位。","pronunciation":["개"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"7c6cc8583a3af1ef","term":"징그럽다","zh":"令人恶心，瘆人","audio":"/audio/7c6cc8583a3af1ef734c.mp3","entryId":"77713","definition":"看起来或摸起来吓人或丑恶，让人起鸡皮疙瘩。","pronunciation":["징그럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/acab334f24c8217106eb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27264","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["它有八条腿，多恶心啊。","站在戏剧舞台上是什么感觉呢？","你为什么那么怕蜘蛛啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["它有八条腿，多恶心啊。","你为什么那么怕蜘蛛啊？","站在戏剧舞台上是什么感觉呢？"],"answer":0}]}
